# Architecture

## Request flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant M as Middleware
    participant R as Router
    participant H as Handler
    participant D1
    participant KV

    B->>M: HTTP request
    M->>M: Add security headers
    M->>M: Rate limit check (public API only)
    alt /api/* path
        M->>R: router.ts
        R->>H: handleXxx(request, env)
        H->>D1: Query
        H-->>B: JSON response
    else page path
        M->>M: Astro SSR render
        M->>D1: Server-side data fetch
        M-->>B: HTML
    end
```

## Component map

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Pages
        Pub[Public pages\n/ /book /academy /join]
        Admin[Admin portal\n/admin/*]
        Docs[Docs site\n/docs/*]
    end

    subgraph API
        PubAPI[Public\n/api/enquiry\n/api/booking\n/api/academy/respond\n/api/health]
        CronAPI[Cron\n/api/cron/*]
        AdminAPI[Admin\n/api/admin/*]
    end

    subgraph Lib
        Bus[business/\nPure functions]
        Repo[repositories/\nD1 CRUD]
        Email[email/\nResend senders]
        Cfg[config.ts\nKV-backed]
    end

    D1[(D1)]
    KV[(KV)]
    RS([Resend])

    Pages --> API
    API --> Bus & Repo & Email & Cfg
    Repo --> D1
    Cfg --> KV
    Email --> RS
```

## Middleware pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Req[Request] --> IsPublic{Public API\nroute?}
    IsPublic -->|Yes| GetIP[Get CF-Connecting-IP]
    GetIP --> KVKey[KV key:\nratelimit:ip:minute]
    KVKey --> Count{count >= 10?}
    Count -->|Yes| R429[429 + Retry-After: 60]
    Count -->|No| Incr[Increment counter TTL 70s]
    Count -->|KV error| Log[Log warn — allow through]
    IsPublic -->|No| Next[next]
    Incr --> Next
    Log --> Next
    Next --> Resp[Add security headers\nto response]
```

## Environment isolation

All D1 queries include `AND environment = ?`. The same physical database serves all three environments — rows are isolated by the `environment` column.

```mermaid
graph LR
    Dev[APP_ENV=development] -->|environment='development'| D1[(D1)]
    Staging[APP_ENV=staging] -->|environment='staging'| D1
    Prod[APP_ENV=production] -->|environment='production'| D1
```

## Project layout

```
src/
├── api/
│   ├── router.ts          ← Single entry point + cron dispatcher
│   ├── helpers.ts         ← ok() err() parseBody() auth helpers
│   ├── enquiry.ts         ← POST /api/enquiry
│   ├── booking.ts         ← POST /api/booking
│   ├── academy.ts         ← POST /api/academy/respond
│   ├── health.ts          ← GET /api/health
│   ├── admin/             ← /api/admin/* handlers
│   └── cron/              ← /api/cron/* handlers
├── lib/
│   ├── auth/admin.ts      ← checkAdminToken requireAdmin
│   ├── business/          ← Pure domain logic — no I/O
│   ├── db/                ← D1 client + TypeScript types
│   ├── email/             ← Resend client + senders
│   ├── errors.ts          ← Error classes + handleApiError
│   ├── repositories/      ← All D1 CRUD functions
│   └── config.ts          ← KV-backed SystemConfig
├── middleware/index.ts    ← Security headers + rate limiting
├── pages/
│   ├── api/[...path].ts   ← Catch-all → router
│   ├── admin/             ← Admin portal
│   ├── docs/              ← This documentation site
│   └── ...                ← Public pages
└── workers/coach-app.js   ← Standalone coach register
```

